================================================================================================
VERDICT
================================================================================================
  first -> second   P4  EFFICIENT  small giveback vs 2R +2.3 SE   vs 3R -2.8 SE   FAILED
  second -> first   P1  FAST  to 2R               vs 2R -0.1 SE   vs 3R +1.2 SE   FAILED

  No rule beat both blind policies on both half-assignments.
  The route to 2R does not carry information the level does
  not — at least not under a hold rule that keeps the original
  stop, which is the only form the ban list permits.
